      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0001,0004,>¿¡Co...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0000,0A00> Codo con codo!?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,>",
