      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0001,0004,>¿¡Estaríamos incluso\npor encima de Kamek!<C:0000,0002,6400>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,>",
